{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id1660750062"}, "name":{"label":"granger2907"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-19T18:16:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"14.9.0"}, "id":{"label":"13866378038"}, "title":{"label":"I had a very frustrating experience with this app."}, "content":{"label":"I had a very frustrating experience with this app.\n\nI made a booking which was later cancelled, yet I was still charged. Agoda claimed I was not charged, but my bank confirmed that the transaction was successfully completed.\n\nWhat’s worse is that the system created a second booking without my clear intention, marked it as non-refundable, and then refused to process a refund. This is extremely misleading and unfair.\n\nThe cancellation policy was not clearly explained, especially the difference between “no-show” and “non-refundable,” which caused confusion.\n\nCustomer service only gave generic responses and kept shifting responsibility instead of resolving the issue properly.\n\nI would not recommend using this app unless you are 100% sure about your booking. Otherwise, you may risk losing your money with no proper support. \n\nI will be reporting this issue and sharing my experience publicly if it is not resolved.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=440676901&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
